{"id":"8f199facc63aa2aa","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison.md","title":"填充保持p等价但改变精确最短长度","display":"thm-polynomial-padding-comparison — 填充保持p等价但改变精确最短长度","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison","aliases":["72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison"],"display":"thm-polynomial-padding-comparison — 填充保持p等价但改变精确最短长度","depends_on":["[[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]]","[[72-df-polynomial-proof]]","[[72-df-proof-system-comparison]]"],"chapter":"VIII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VIII coding and comparison discussion §§2.2–2.4; complete local padding argument","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-polynomial-padding-comparison — 填充保持p等价但改变精确最短长度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1039d90e5cc4edb6\" href=\"?note=1039d90e5cc4edb6\" title=\"72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system\">72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b7212f0a8db1c2a3\" href=\"?note=b7212f0a8db1c2a3\" title=\"72-df-polynomial-proof\">72-df-polynomial-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b16c13e741889b14\" href=\"?note=b16c13e741889b14\" title=\"72-df-proof-system-comparison\">72-df-proof-system-comparison</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VIII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VIII coding and comparison discussion §§2.2–2.4; complete local padding argument"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>P、k、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P^{\\langle k\\rangle}\">\\(P^{\\langle k\\rangle}\\)</span>、pad沿用所引定义；τ∈TAUT 且 τ≠τ₀。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P^{\\langle k\\rangle}),\\qquad P\\equiv_pP^{\\langle k\\rangle}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P^{\\langle k\\rangle}),\\qquad P\\equiv_pP^{\\langle k\\rangle}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s_{P^{\\langle k\\rangle}}(\\tau)=s_P(\\tau)^k+s_P(\\tau)+1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s_{P^{\\langle k\\rangle}}(\\tau)=s_P(\\tau)^k+s_P(\\tau)+1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>前向转换写出 pad_k(w)，固定 k 下耗时多项式；反向成功解析时输出 w，非法串时输出一份固定的 P 证明 τ₀。填充系统的全性、可靠性与满射因此成立。对 τ≠τ₀，只有合法填充串能输出 τ，其长度恰 |w|ᵏ+|w|+1；该函数严格递增，所以在最短原证明处取得新最短值。排除 τ₀ 必要，因为非法短串可能直接输出它。这个例子具体解释了为何精确大小依赖编码，而多项式等价仍保持。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system","status":"resolved","id":"1039d90e5cc4edb6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-polynomial-proof","status":"resolved","id":"b7212f0a8db1c2a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-polynomial-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-proof-system-comparison","status":"resolved","id":"b16c13e741889b14","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-proof-system-comparison]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"P^{\\langle k\\rangle}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PropProofSystem}(P^{\\langle k\\rangle}),\\qquad P\\equiv_pP^{\\langle k\\rangle}.","display":true},{"tex":"s_{P^{\\langle k\\rangle}}(\\tau)=s_P(\\tau)^k+s_P(\\tau)+1.","display":true}],"bytes":1706,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-78","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-clause-restriction]] · [[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]] · [[72-df-resolution-width]] · [[72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-universal]] · [[72-thm-resolution-restriction]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-74","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-clause-restriction]] · [[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]] · [[72-df-resolution-width]] · [[72-lem-clause-restriction-semantics]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-boundedness-simulation]] · [[72-thm-polynomial-padding-comparison]] · [[72-thm-proof-system-join-universal]] · [[72-thm-resolution-restriction]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-72","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VIII章新增8项：[[72-df-clause-restriction]] · [[72-df-polynomially-padded-proof-system]] · [[72-df-resolution-width]] · [[72-lem-clause-restricti